60
00:05:54,571 --> 00:06:08,999
And again, Moses man, you know, kind of watershed for projects of this type and the grouping of the houses together.

61
00:06:09,359 --> 00:06:12,421
I think it all adds up to a house that wants to be

62
00:06:14,507 --> 00:06:19,731
