791
00:56:17,425 --> 00:56:28,031
Yeah, I was able to, the homeowner was gracious enough to allow me to access to the building to do some architectural documentation in the terms of measurements, the building inside and out.

792
00:56:28,691 --> 00:56:33,994
Just have a quick one page summary to do on the findings which are very basic.

793
00:56:35,495 --> 00:56:38,716
Basically the house is mostly intact.

794
00:56:40,715 --> 00:56:42,216
There were a few changes that you can see.

795
