796
00:56:43,857 --> 00:56:47,959
There's China cabinet and stuff, but the house mainly retains a lot of its integrity.

797
00:56:49,239 --> 00:56:56,763
I think we felt that the architect and the homeowner were very willing to restore a lot of that detail and character back.

798
00:56:56,803 --> 00:57:02,706
So we are, now that that documentation is done, we are comfortable with allowing them to proceed.

799
00:57:05,207 --> 00:57:05,708
Okay, great.

800
00:57:06,982 --> 00:57:12,669
Um, so, um, is there anything we need to screen share or show the other commissioners or are we good.

801
00:57:14,672 --> 00:57:24,244
Okay, the drawings if people want to see them, but the photos basically the photo show all they need to but I don't know if.

802
00:57:28,818 --> 00:57:44,183
I think the biggest thing here was that the building fit in so nicely with the four other buildings on the form A, and that was the most important thing with kind of keeping the consistency with that streetscape on this project.

803
00:57:47,364 --> 00:57:51,506
So if the subcommittee is cool with that, then I will go around for a roll call vote.

804
00:57:52,646 --> 00:57:55,587
Actually, well, let's make a motion formally.

805
00:57:57,350 --> 00:58:10,278
make a motion to lift the demo delay for 17 Edward Street contingent that the homeowner submit the current architectural plans for final permit.

806
00:58:12,719 --> 00:58:13,239
Okay, great.

807
00:58:14,360 --> 00:58:14,820
Seconded.

808
00:58:15,140 --> 00:58:15,841
Thank you, Jess.

809
00:58:16,141 --> 00:58:20,664
I'm not on the subcommittee, but I still second it because I trust my colleagues so much.

810
00:58:20,684 --> 00:58:21,464
That's okay, we'll take it.

811
00:58:21,484 --> 00:58:22,064
We'll take it.

812
00:58:23,867 --> 00:58:37,470
Okay, so we have a motion on the table to lift the demo delay at 17 Edward Street pending uploading the most recent plans to the permitting system, which, you know, Ryan and I have access to so we can verify.

813
00:58:37,490 --> 00:58:43,651
Jen you froze.

