831
00:59:21,315 --> 00:59:24,557
So we have two agenda items for this property.

832
00:59:25,037 --> 00:59:36,264
The first one being that the Historic District Commission asked us to discuss our thoughts on a local historic district for this property.

833
00:59:37,404 --> 00:59:46,910
So before we move on to the next agenda item, which might be lifting the demo delay, I wanted to just get folks thoughts on

834
00:59:47,955 --> 00:59:50,157
a local historic district for this property.

835
00:59:51,057 --> 00:59:59,963
And I think Doug or Ryan or Peter, since you've been working with the homeowners, perhaps you can just kind of shed a little light on what's been happening here.

836
01:00:00,003 --> 01:00:04,966
I think just a recap would be helpful to the folks that are listening in tonight.

837
01:00:08,289 --> 01:00:10,630
Yeah, I did correspond with them today too.

838
01:00:10,750 --> 01:00:14,373
And I don't know if any of them are here, but I think they,

839
01:00:16,310 --> 01:00:17,631
