933
01:09:09,774 --> 01:09:18,217
I think we just moved to release the demo delay.

934
01:09:18,317 --> 01:09:25,139
No, I'd like to move on to that agenda item next, officially, to vote to release demo delay.

935
01:09:25,179 --> 01:09:29,941
So I think Ryan, Doug, Peter, again, I think it's important here.

936
01:09:31,138 --> 01:09:31,318
Yeah.

937
01:09:31,338 --> 01:09:33,319
I think it might be worthwhile.

938
01:09:33,419 --> 01:09:34,960
To see if there's any public comments here as well.

939
01:09:55,985 --> 01:10:02,408
Yeah, I'm happy to, if there's anybody here that would like to speak one way or the other on 78 Cotting Street, happy to.

940
01:10:03,108 --> 01:10:08,071
I mean, again, we did receive two letters, so we did get public comment since our last meeting.

941
01:10:08,111 --> 01:10:14,814
So if anyone's here to speak specifically, I'm happy to just, you know, make, raise your hand or unmute yourself.

