01:10:16,655 --> 01:10:16,995
Hello?

943
01:10:18,096 --> 01:10:21,197
Yes, ma'am, can we get your name and address for the record, please?

944
01:10:21,577 --> 01:10:23,578
Yeah, this is Mariana Ducey at 2 North Street.

